    "Major aortic anomalies in Turner syndrome and prevalence are discussed. Clinical guidelines focus on Turner syndrome and highlight aortic dissection. Genes such as ACTA2, PRKG1, and MYLK mutations are associated with specific aortic conditions including aneurysms and dissections. Further studies focus on the relationship of genetic variants to Turner syndrome and aortic pathologies. Family clustering of aortic diseases and valve disorders is also examined.": "genes",
